# ABRASAX-7D-Crystal -- never publish build output, runtime state, or secrets.
#
# Why this file exists: the published tree carried 2913 blobs / 573.8 MB, and
# 470 MB of that was Rust build output committed by accident --
#   .pdb   184.2 MB (106 files)
#   .rmeta 180.9 MB (220 files)
#   .rlib  110.8 MB (77 files)
# plus 47.5 MB of .dll and 25.8 MB of .exe. Nothing here needs to be in git.
#
# Deliberately NOT ignored: cuda/build/ and kernels/cuda/build/. Those hold the
# .ptx/.cubin/.dll artifacts that cuda_kernel_loader.py loads at runtime, and
# kernels/cuda/test_kernel_loader.py proves 19/19 kernels bind from them on the
# GTX 1660 Ti. They are shipped compiled because the build needs nvcc.

# ---- rust build output ----
target/
**/target/
*.rlib
*.rmeta
*.pdb
*.d

# ---- MSVC link intermediates (not the shipped .dll/.lib) ----
*.obj
*.exp
*.ilk

# ---- python ----
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache/

# ---- runtime state: 205 checkpoints written on a timer, none belong here ----
CRYSTAL/
logs/
*.log
*.jsonl

# ---- vendored environments: declare dependencies, do not commit them ----
.venv/
**/.venv/

# ---- credentials ----
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
**/secrets/**
**/credentials*.json
_keys_probe.json

# ---- os noise ----
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
